 have been passed to Sue Hearn       JNCC have requested permission from all agencies/contributors to make this database available as open data 2016-05-11 (Lynn Heeley is main contact).  In principal NRW have agreed providing the database does not contain personal data or sensitive species.  When confirmed we will need to amend the metadata to OGL licences, requests would be referred to JNCC and we can add the correct resource locator.   Data was released under an OGL in 2016.  Personal data (recorder names) has been redacted.  Information about the original restrictions is held in the ReadMe file in the archive media 1196\tNatural England-Joint Nature Conservation Committee (JNCC)-Scottish Natural Heritage (SNH)-Natural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2013-12-31\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2026-03-03T16:09:58.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17070\tEXT_DS24320\t2024-05-28T12:10:10.588Z\t316\tInvalid\tEditable\tFuturecoast (3rd Party Data)\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-3234333230\tArchived as Project No. 426, Media No. 1459, 1460, 1461, 1462.\tGIS Service Desk Terrestrial Science Group, NRW External Custodian: Beth Greenaway (020) 72381587 beth.greenaway@defra.gsi.gov.uk\tDEFRA (Department for Environment, Food and Rural Affairs)\t\t2002-12-31\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2026-03-03T13:06:38.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17074\tEXT_DS47100\t2024-05-28T12:10:10.864Z\t344\tUnassessed\tEditable\tEffects of Air Pollution and Climate Change on Welsh Calcicolous Ecosystems (3rd Party Data)\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-3437313030\tPaper reports: Room G4 shelves, Monitoring Team, Environmental Change Group.  Raw data: ECG R:drive.\tGIS Service Desk  Environmental Audit Group, NRW External Contact: Centre for Ecology and Hydrology (CEH)       Alternative Title: Effects of Air pollution and climate change on British Calcicolous ecosystems - Welsh sites    Alternative Title: Effeithiau llygredd aer a newid hinsawdd ar ecosystemau calchgar Cymru     Temporal Ext