 copies are held on the restricted access GRASSURV directory on the N:drive of Terrestrial Science Group. Copies of the site packs have also been distributed to the relevant regional offices.  The paper copies are held together in TSG files. The site files and other info on Ffynnon has not been superseded by the Recorder database as the latter only contains the quadrat data and site logistical info (e.g. not maps, descriptions, evaluations). Some files relating to sites in south Glamorgan and Gwent are kept in CCW\u0027s Cardiff office.\tData Custodian: Stuart Smith, Grassland Ecologist, Terrestrial Science Group, CCW Metadata contact: Data Services Team, NRW\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2004-12-31\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T12:08:40.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17547\tNRW_DS101931\t2024-05-28T12:26:25.146Z\t380\tValid\tEditable\tIntertidal Infauna of the Usk and Wye and Severn Estuaries 2004\tIsfilod rhynglanwol yn aberoedd Wysg a Gwy 2004\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313031393331\tThe data are archived as Project No 406, Media No 1424.  A copy is also stored at H:\\MFSG\\Marine_Habitats_and_Species\\Marine Monitoring\\Intid Severn\\2004 Usk and Wye Infauna 2004\tIntertidal Custodian: Intertidal Ecologist, Marine and Freshwater Ecosystems Group, NRW Metadata Contact: Data Services, NRW\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2004-11-11\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2026-03-03T12:27:59.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\tMEDIN\tPublic record\n17549\tNRW_DS101965\t2024-05-28T12:26:25.181Z\t504\tValid\tEditable\tIntertidal Designated Site Assessment Documents and Data\tDogfennau Asesiadau Safleoedd Dynodedig Rhynglanwol\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313031393635\tThese reports and data are archived as Project No 270, Media No 569 and 981\tInternal Custodian; Intertidal Ecologist, Marine and Freshwater Ecosystems Group, NRW. Metadata point of contact: Data Services Team\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\tNRW Conditional\t2010-06-30\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2026-