ronmental Policy Group\tInternal Contact: Rowland Sharp, Senior Advisor, SW Area Operations (Marine)       This is part of a larger dataset the Sea Fishing Atlas of Wales. (which consisted of three parts) The regulations bit is just held in the marine archive and is not available on the X drive.  This is because no-one has ever asked for it and it was a snapshot and I imagine completely out of date so as long as the project and media number are there I don’t think we need a X drive location.    Removed from public view on the advice of marine fisheries experts as information is dated and could be misleading.\tAssociation Of Sea Fisheries Committees-Natural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2009-01-31\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2026-03-03T14:53:55.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n17780\tNRW_DS110500\t2024-05-28T12:31:29.132Z\t0\tUnassessed\tEditable\tCompetent Authorities for Fisheries in Welsh Waters\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313130353030\ta) Report available from NRW library  b) Available on the hard drives of Clare Eno and Rowland Sharp, NRW Environmental Policy Group c) Archived as project 332, media 1291 (File path: K\\Archive\\Media 1200to1300\\Media 1291\tInternal Contact: Colin Charman, Lead Specialist Advisor – Marine Fisheries, Marine \u0026amp; Coastal Policy \u0026amp; Planning Team Metadata Contact: Data Services Team, NRW       Removed from public view on the advice of marine fisheries experts as information is dated and could be misleading.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2009-01-31\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2026-03-03T14:53:56.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n17788\tNRW_DS110501\t2024-05-28T12:31:29.297Z\t1047\tValid\tEditable\tModelling of Habitat Networks for Welsh Woodlands, Grasslands, Heathlands, Bogs and Fens\tModelu Rhwydweithiau Cynefinoedd ar gyfer coetiroedd, glaswelltiroedd, rhostiroedd, corsydd a ffeniau yng Nghymru\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313130353031\tX:\\Biological\\Habitat Networks\\Habitat Networks all Wales\