 include this in the licence.  Due to national security reason, you must send any raw data extracts you receive from the data custodian password protected. (Please ask custodian or Simon Bonwick/Andrew Jeffery for help with this if required). Please send password and data in a separate email. Otherwise the NGRs must be abbreviated to 4 digits.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T12:59:13.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n18278\tNRW_DS116315\t2024-05-28T12:44:33.939Z\t5\tUnassessed\tEditable\tSummary Shellfish Directive Assessments\tCrynodeb o Asesiadau Cyfarwyddeb Pysgod Cregyn\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313136333135\t[A]  Data available in Biosys [B]  Packaged published version available on Sharefile.\tThere is a small risk that this data can be considered commercially confidential but is difficult to assess. However, these data would be made available under an EIR request and as such these would inevitably lead to disclosure where the public interest test has been applied.  For this reason we consider it unnecessary that this slight risk should prevent full access.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\tOpen Government Licence\t2016-10-25\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2026-03-03T17:09:48.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18279\tNRW_DS116316\t2024-05-28T12:44:33.947Z\t9\tUnassessed\tEditable\tSeagrass Taxa and Abundance\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313136333136\t[A]  Data extracted from Biosys [B] X:\\Monitoring\\Marine\\Seagrass Areas [C] X:\\Monitoring\\Marine\\Seagrass Quadrats\t\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2017-06-08\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2026-03-03T16:17:33.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18276\tNRW_DS116317\t2024-05-28T12:44:33.866Z\t608\tUnassessed\tEditable\tWater Framework Directive (WFD) Rocky Shore Macroalgal Species\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313136333137\tBioSys WISKI KiEco\t\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2017-06-08\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2026-03-03T14:57:56.000Z\tAstun Technology