 Wales (NRW)\t\t2017-07-20\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-07-08T09:01:31.000Z\tnobody nobody\t-\tPublic record\n18316\tNRW_DS116336\t2024-05-28T12:45:27.977Z\t2706\tValid\tEditable\tWaste Permit Returns Data Interrogator\tHolwr Data Cofnodion Trwyddedau Gwastraff\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313136333336\tWaste Returns database and PALs database\tDataset point of contact: John Fry, Lead Specialist Advisor, Waste Policy\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\tOpen Government Licence\t2025-07-07\tpublication\tnull\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/documents/2619\t2025-12-19T10:43:00.000Z\tMonica Jones\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n18318\tNRW_DS116337\t2024-05-28T12:45:28.024Z\t604\tValid\tEditable\tHydropower Permits\tTrwyddedau Ynni Dwr\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313136333337\tData Extracted from Permitting And Licencing System (PALS) Data Stored in NALD from 2013-04-01 to 2016-02-26 and then Permitting And Licencing System from 2016-07-01\tData Custodian: Henry Forrest - Permitting Centre Wales, Cardiff\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\tOpen Government Licence\t2026-03-12\tpublication\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/capabilities/layer/3512/?ows_service\u003dwms\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/layers/geonode:nrw_hydropower_permits\t2026-03-16T18:12:17.000Z\tRachel Morris\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n18322\tNRW_DS116338\t2024-05-28T12:45:28.321Z\t1208\tValid\tEditable\tUK Water Quality Sampling Harmonised Monitoring Scheme Detailed Data\tData Manwl Cynllun Monitro Cytûn Samplo Ansawdd Dŵr y DU\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313136333338\tY:\\Knowledge_and_Information_Management\\NRW Data Publishing Area\\Open Data\tInternal custodian: Mark Squire / (previously) Julie Boswell\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2023-06-22\tpublication\tnull\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/documents/2633\t2025-05-02T15:16:18.000Z\tnobody nobody\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n18311\tNRW_DS116339\t2024-05-28T12:45:27.920Z\t964\tUnassessed\tEditable\tRiver Habitat Survey (RHS)\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313136333339\tThis dataset sits within Kieco - WISKI module.   [A]  This data is available on Sharefile and is classed as Open Data and static at the moment, until we can get an update out of WISKI.\tNicola Wiltshire, Environmental Monitoring Officer 1, Rhymney \u0026amp; Ebbw A\u0026amp;R, NRW Mel Lacan, Senior Environmental Monitoring Officer, Rhymney \u0026amp; Ebbw A\u0026amp;R, NRW       Notes from 17/07/2018 The RHS data only currently goes up to 2014. When EAW split from EA we got an excel spreadsheet which contains the 1994 - 2004 data, extracted from EA\u0027s Ecosys module. This RHS acts as summary dataset, which is adequate for most people to use, and it includes indices of habitat type. This data is now stored in Keico (WISKI) which contains a lot of data from 2003 onwards. Pre 2003 the methodology was different so it has been hard to get the data into keico, Mel Lacan is hoping that by the end of the year, the data will be entered and they can start reporting again, therefore updating this dataset.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2020-10-01\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-04-17T12:30:15.000Z\tnobody nobody\t-\tPublic record\n18323\tNRW_DS116340\t2024-05-28T12:45:28.320Z\t946\tValid\tEditable\tWater Framework Directive (WFD) Risk Assessments for Cycle 2\tAsesiadau Risg y Gyfarwyddeb Fframwaith Dŵr ar gyfer Cylch 2\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313136333430\tDMS spreadsheets with the WFD team\tRobert Blacklidge Environmental reporting team\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\tOpen Government Licence\t2016-10-25\tpublication\tnull\thttps://naturalresources.wales/evidence-and-data/research-and-reports/water-reports/river-basin-management-plans-published/?lang\u003den\t2025-05-07T15:34:01.000Z\tnobody nobody\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n18320\tNRW_DS116342\t2024-05-28T12:45:28.220Z\t1822\tValid\tEditable\tHistoric Flood Warnings and Flood Alerts\tRhybuddion i Fod yn Barod am Lifogydd a Rhybuddion Llifogydd Hanesyddol\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313136333432\tEmailed every quarter from EA, but in 2016 the data will come via