ted version as previous version as we may need to go back to any layers which were issued to marine licence applicants in the past in case there is a dispute.               Update from Laura Grant April 2025: The published dataset hasn\u0027t been updated since 2018. The schedule for 6 month updates was probably overoptimistic when this was said.  However they do intend to update it sometime this year (2025) and they are also hoping eventually to set up something in FME to improve the update process as it is taking a long time to do this manually.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\tOpen Government Licence\t2018-01-03\tpublication\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/capabilities/layergroup/881/?ows_service\u003dwms\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/layergroups/inspire-nrw:MarineLicensingBand1SensitiveAreas\t2026-03-03T12:02:28.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\tGEMINI \u0026 MEDIN\tPublic record\n18393\tNRW_DS119019\t2024-05-28T12:47:56.418Z\t495\tValid\tEditable\tThe Wales Outdoor Recreation Survey\tArolwg Hamdden Awyr Agored Cymru\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313139303139\tNRW website and folder in the DMS  https://naturalresources.wales/media/4757/wales-outdoor-recreation-survey-2014-final-report.pdf\tSue Williams: Head of social Sciences.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2017-05-19\tpublication\tnull\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/documents/2641\t2025-05-02T14:48:17.000Z\tnobody nobody\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n18394\tNRW_DS119026\t2024-05-28T12:47:56.452Z\t742\tUnassessed\tEditable\tEnvironment Agency Wales (EAW) Landholdings\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313139303236\tX:\\Ownership\\NRW Land\\Ex EAW Landholdings.lyr\tIan Medcalf, GIS Officer, NRW William Patterson, Assistant Surveyor National Services, NRW\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2020-10-22\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-07-08T09:01:34.000Z\tnobody nobody\t-\tPublic record\n18391\tNRW_DS119037\t2024-05-28T12:47:56.412Z\t524\tUnassessed\tEditable\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW) Landholdings\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313139303337\tX:\\Own