e between the two.  Each layer will be updated as new evidence becomes available. The published data is technically the dataset generated for Reg35 but is the most recent information to inform Reg 37\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\tOpen Government Licence\t2024-04-17\tpublication\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/capabilities/layergroup/886/?ows_service\u003dwms\tnull\t2026-03-03T12:01:28.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\tGEMINI \u0026 MEDIN\tPublic record\n18386\tNRW_DS119124\t2024-05-28T12:47:56.049Z\t1354\tValid\tEditable\tNational Marine Character Areas (NMCA)\tArdaloedd Cymeriad Morol Cenedlaethol\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313139313234\tX:\\Physical\\Landscape\\National Marine Character Areas.lyr\tJohn Briggs- Landscape Architect, PPG.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\tOpen Government Licence\t2025-01-30\tpublication\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/capabilities/layer/390/?ows_service\u003dwms\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/layers/inspire-nrw:NRW_MARINE_CHARACTER_AREAS\t2026-03-03T11:15:29.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\tGEMINI \u0026 MEDIN\tPublic record\n18436\tNRW_DS119125\t2024-05-28T12:48:36.190Z\t300\tUnassessed\tEditable\tSpecial Area of Conservation (SAC) Monitoring: Shad Egg Survey on the River Wye (2017)\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313139313235\tDMS \u0026gt; Sampling, Monitoring, Analysis \u0026amp; Reporting \u0026gt; Freshwater Monitoring \u0026gt; Running Waters Habitat Directive 3rd reporting cycle \u0026gt; Shad Fish Species - 3rd Reporting Cycle \u0026gt; Wye DMS \u0026gt; Sampling, Monitoring, Analysis \u0026amp; Reporting \u0026gt; Freshwater Monitoring \u0026gt; Running Waters Habitats Directive Data Cycle 3 \u0026gt; Wye Shad \u0026gt; Workbook Wye shad egg surveys 2013 onwards.xlsx\tNRW Freshwater Monitoring Co-ordinator: Heather Garrett.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2017-06-30\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-04-17T12:30:16.000Z\tnobody nobody\t-\tPublic record\n18441\tNRW_DS119129\t2024-05-28T12:48:36.315Z\t716\tUnassessed\tEditable\tGrey Seal Halichoerus grypu