dy\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n18505\tNRW_DS121391\t2024-05-28T12:50:14.350Z\t432\tUnassessed\tEditable\tAssessing Sensitivity of Welsh Marine Special Areas of Conservation (SACs) and Special Protection Areas (SPAs) Features to Unregulated and Partially Regulated Activities\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313231333931\tDMS Evidence\u0026gt;Marine\u0026gt;Projects\u0026gt;Contracts\u0026gt;Assessing sensitivities of Welsh MPA features to unregulated activities\tInternal Data Custodian: Laura Grant, Specialist Advisor -Marine Ecologist, Marine \u0026amp; Coastal Ecosystems Team   Metadata Contact: Data Services Team        Extra info from Laura Grant: There are a couple of reasons why we don’t want to let the public to get hold of this data at the moment. It is part of an interim project and it needs further work before publication.  If the spreadsheets were released now then they could be taken out of context.  Some of the spreadsheets contain data supplied by Natural England.  NE state ‘: We are currently exploring charging for certain advice on operations products, particularly where we have used contracts to conduct some of the assessments as a way of recouping some of this cost. With this in mind, it is very important that this information is not shared any wider than yourselves.  Some of the spreadsheets contain data supplied by MarLIN.  There is ongoing discussion as to who owns the data and MarLIN currently don’t want the information released in the form it appears in these spreadsheets.  DO NOT SET FOR EXPORT.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2018-03-16\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2026-03-03T17:08:46.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n18498\tNRW_DS121392\t2024-05-28T12:50:14.327Z\t660\tValid\tEditable\tWoodland Grant Scheme\tCynllun Grant Coetir\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313231333932\tX:\\Resource Management\\Land Management\\Woodland Grant Scheme 1.lyr  X:\\Resource Management\\Land Management\\Woodland Grant Scheme 2.lyr  X:\\Resource Management\\Land Management\\Woodland Grant Scheme 3.lyr\tKeith Harri Jones- Spatial team Leader\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2018-04-01\tpublication\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/layergroups/inspire-nrw:WoodlandGrantScheme\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/layergroups/inspire-nrw:WoodlandGrantScheme\t2025-03-04T08:46:29.431Z\tnobody nobody\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n18496\tNRW_DS121398\t2024-05-28T12:50:14.252Z\t1397\tUnassessed\tEditable\tUK Coastal Flood Forecasting (UKCFF) Tide Gauge Network\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313231333938\tAlthough NRW is supplied the whole dataset, the Mumbles head data is the only data held in WISKI 7 Hydro and telemetry.\tAndy Wall Alison Hanson Liam Perrott, Technical Specialist Hydrometry       Not to publish to data.gov.uk\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)-Scottish Environment Protection Agency (SEPA)-Environment Agency (EA)-Department of Agriculture, Environment and Rural Affairs\t\t2018-03-23\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2026-03-03T16:27:49.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n18491\tNRW_DS121508\t2024-05-28T12:50:13.935Z\t330\tUnassessed\tEditable\tWater Framework Directive Cycle 2Target Catchments Rivers\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313231353038\tx:\\EU Directives\\Water Framework Directive\\Cycle2\\WFD Target Rivers Catchments Cycle 2 2015.lyr\tRhian Thomas, Water Framework Directive Team Leader, Water Team\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2021-12-31\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-07-08T09:06:51.000Z\tnobody nobody\t-\tPublic record\n18495\tNRW_DS121509\t2024-05-28T12:50:14.255Z\t375\tUnassessed\tEditable\tWater Framework Directive Cycle 2 - Target Waterbodies Groundwater\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313231353039\tx:\\EU Directives\\Water Framework Directive\\Cycle2\\WFD Target Groundwater Waterbodies Cycle 2 2015.lyr\tRhian Thomas, Water Framework Directive Team Leader, Water Team\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2021-12-31\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-04-17T09:58:05.000Z\tnobody nobody\t-\tPublic record\n18493\tNRW_DS121510\t2024-05-28T12:50:14.0