e lodged at the Pembrokeshire Achive and therefore become public information.  detailed metadata (required for the JoE) explains the data futher and is stored in the DMS.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)-Zoological Society London (ZSL)\tOpen Government Licence\t2019-10-28\tpublication\tnull\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/documents/2611\t2026-03-03T16:24:55.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\tGEMINI \u0026 MEDIN\tPublic record\n18798\tNRW_DS124197\t2024-05-28T12:56:21.014Z\t4\tUnassessed\tEditable\tEA Environment Management Teams\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313234313937\tx:\\Resource Management\\NRW Operational Areas\\EA Environment Management Teams.lyr\t\t\t\t2019-05-23\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T12:59:29.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18799\tNRW_DS124283\t2024-05-28T12:56:20.997Z\t688\tUnassessed\tEditable\tWater Framework Directive (WFD) Coastal Catchments Cycle 2\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313234323833\tx:\\EU Directives\\Water Framework Directive\\Cycle2\\WFD Coastal Catchments Cycle 2.lyr\tInternal custodian - Rob Blacklidge - Environment Reporting.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\tOpen Government Licence\t2023-04-25\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-12-24T11:20:13.000Z\tMonica Jones\t-\tPublic record\n18802\tNRW_DS124436\t2024-05-28T12:56:20.965Z\t731\tValid\tEditable\tAsh Lichen Alert\tRhybuddion Cennau Ynn\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313234343336\tX:\\Incidents\\Forest Health\\Ash lichens alert.lyr X:\\Incidents\\Forest Health\\Ash lichens alert 1km.lyr\tInternal Custodian: Sam Bosanquet, Specialist Advisor – Terrestrial Ecosystems \u0026amp; Species, Terrestrial Ecosystems \u0026amp; Species Team\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2022-07-29\tpublication\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/capabilities/layergroup/3598/?ows_service\u003dwms\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/layergroups/geonode:nrw_ash_lichen_alerts\t2025-07-18T14:57:38.314Z\tnobody nobody\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n18801\tNRW_DS124618\t2024-05-28T12:56:20.896Z\t2\tUnassessed\tEditable\tNRW Water Quality