nsider promotional/nice images to be data and would just delete the entry. Alternatively perhaps change it for a general entry about the content of the NRW Image store in the same way we have a general entry for WISKI content or Marine Recorder content (it could include general information about the archive of slides that Jill/Dwyn currently hold too?).  Bryan Tozer would be best placed to help write a generic entry for the NRW image store (the lineage could include a sentence that described that this now contains what was previously knows as the CCW image library – a set of presentation level images used for promotional purposes). NRW holds so many images, unless they are a specifically data e.g. photo-monitoring time series of site/feature or something that is digitally analysed using software I wouldnt bother with metadata entries for them as they are not data and I don’t think they fall under our remit to give advice on.  If those that are considered data tend to be part of a larger dataset and are captures as part of the metadata for the larger dataset.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T12:59:33.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n17407\tNRW_DS64560\t2024-05-28T12:22:33.414Z\t5\tUnassessed\tEditable\tNRW Aerial Photographs of Wales\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-3634353630\t\t\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T10:52:26.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n17402\tNRW_DS64561\t2024-05-28T12:22:33.137Z\t1282\tUnassessed\tEditable\tAdmiralty Charts (Paper Records)\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-3634353631\tVarious paper maps are available through HQ and Regional offices.\tInternal Custodian: Keith Jones, GIS Data Manager, Information Management Group, CCW\tUnited Kingdom Hydrographic Office (UKHO)\t\t2013-12-31\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-03-07T15:58:53.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n17399\tNRW_DS64563\t2024-05-28T12:22:32.579Z\t712\tUnassessed\tEditable\tNatural Resources Wa