s of a NRW licence following an assessment of the data.\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233323134\tX:\\Basemapping\\Admin Boundaries\\Marine plan area Wales WGS84.lyr ,  X:\\Basemapping\\Admin Boundaries\\Wales National Marine Plan Area.lyr  (British National Grid projection)\tGeospatial Team, Knowledge Information Management\tThe Geospatial Services Team do not currently hold any information for this section. If you are the custodian, please contact the team so we can populate this field.  There is also no information about the creator or ownership of these datasets.  Welsh Government?\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T10:30:43.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n17256\tEXT_DS123335\t2024-05-28T12:18:11.237Z\t0\tUnassessed\tEditable\tEnvironment Agency: NRW Alternate Class Area WGS84 (3rd Party Data)\t© Environment Agency Data may be re-used under the terms of the 3rd Party Suppliers Open Licence providing it is done so, acknowledging both the source and owners copyright.  It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233333335\tX:\\Monitoring\\Marine\\Saltmarsh Areas\\NRW Alternate Class Area WGS84.lyr\tMarine Monitoring Offcier\tWater Framework Directive saltmarsh monitoring. Saltmarsh areas of uncertainty taken from 2018 aerial imagery. These areas required ground-truthing to determine the species present. In coordinate system WGS84 for ease of use on hand held differential GPS device.  This data is Open, but owned by the Environemnt Agency\tEnvironment Agency (EA)\t2018-09-30\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-03-07T15:52:36.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n17252\tEXT_DS123364\t2024-05-28T12:18:10.957Z\t10\tUnassessed\tEditable\tForestry Commission Great Britain (FCGB) Forest Research Experiment Sites (3rd Party Data)\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233333634\tx:\\Ownership\\Monitoring Equipment\\FCGB Forest Research Experiment Sites.lyr\tGeospatial Team, Knowledge Informa