be used in conjunction with other datasets to provide a better understanding of the area. They have also been attributed with a \"Failing Water Body\" status (Amber or Red). This identifies mines which are understood to be contributing to failures to achieve good ecological or chemical status in water bodies with High (red) or low (amber) confidence. This attribute was applied in 2020 and only to sites within water bodies identified as failing in the 2018 Water Framework Directive (WFD) Cycle 2 classification.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t2025-07-09\tpublication\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/capabilities/layer/7651/?ows_service\u003dwms\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/layers/geonode:nrw_metal_mines\t2025-12-01T17:41:37.250Z\tRachel Morris\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n18697\tNRW_DS123311\t2024-05-28T12:54:22.268Z\t2\tUnassessed\tEditable\tMine Water Discharges\t© CNC/NRW Data may only be re-used externally under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence following an assessment of the data.\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233333131\tx:\\Industrial\\Mines\\Mine Water Discharges.lyr\tTrystan James\t\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T10:02:21.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18693\tNRW_DS123312\t2024-05-28T12:54:22.107Z\t5\tUnassessed\tEditable\tMining Impact Non Coal\t© CNC/NRW Data may only be re-used externally under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence following an assessment of the data.\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233333132\tx:\\Industrial\\Mines\\Mining Impact NonCoal.lyr\tTrystan James, Team Leader, Geoscience, Geoscience/Knowledge Strategy \u0026amp; Planning\t\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T10:45:19.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18700\tNRW_DS123313\t2024-05-28T12:54:22.296Z\t1\tUnassessed\tEditable\tPPC Air Emissions Points\tAccess restrictions on this data have not been determined.  It may contain sensitive information and therefore may be restricted under legislation.  NRW may provide access to this dataset on request, however NRW may not release, publish or disseminate the data or derived products freely without further assessment.\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233333133\tx:\\Industrial\\Pollution and Waste\\PPC Air Emissions Points.lyr\tJulie Boswell\t\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T10:02:20.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18688\tNRW_DS123314\t2024-05-28T12:54:22.104Z\t1\tUnassessed\tEditable\tPPC Installation Boundary\t© CNC/NRW Data may only be re-used externally under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence following an assessment of the data.\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233333134\tx:\\Industrial\\Pollution and Waste\\PPC Installation Boundary.lyr\tJulie Boswell\t\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T10:02:18.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18685\tNRW_DS123315\t2024-05-28T12:54:21.584Z\t1\tUnassessed\tEditable\tPPC Sewer Emission Points\t© CNC/NRW Data may only be re-used externally under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence following an assessment of the data.\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233333135\tx:\\Industrial\\Pollution and Waste\\PPC Sewer Emission Points.lyr\tJulie Boswell\t\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T10:30:15.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18690\tNRW_DS123316\t2024-05-28T12:54:22.092Z\t1\tUnassessed\tEditable\tPPC Water Emission Points\t© CNC/NRW Data may only be re-used externally under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence following an assessment of the data.\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233333136\tx:\\Industrial\\Pollution and Waste\\PPC Water Emission Points.lyr\tJulie Boswell\t\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T10:45:08.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18694\tNRW_DS123317\t2024-05-28T12:54:22.228Z\t2\tUnassessed\tEditable\tRadioactive Sites Non Nuclear\t© CNC/NRW Data may only be re-used externally under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence following an assessment of the data.\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233333137\tx:\\Industrial\\Pollution