ine with the terms of a NRW licence following an assessment of the data.\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233343634\tX:\\Utilities\\Renewables\\PCNP Wind Turbines.lyr\t\tThe Geospatial Services Team do not currently hold any information for this section. If you are the custodian, please contact the team so we can populate this field.  This data appears to illustrate where applications for wind turbine have been lodged for the Pembrokeshire Coast National Park and their status.\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T11:14:09.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18812\tNRW_DS123465\t2024-05-28T12:56:21.928Z\t14\tUnassessed\tEditable\tWind Farms\t© CNC/NRW Data may only be re-used externally under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence following an assessment of the data.\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233343635\tx:\\Utilities\\Renewables\\Wind Farm Points.lyr ,  x:\\Utilities\\Renewables\\Wind Farm Polygons.lyr\tThe data was originally supplied by Julie Avery.\tThe Geospatial Services Team do not currently hold any information for this section. If you are the custodian, please contact the team so we can populate this field.\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T11:14:09.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18811\tNRW_DS123478\t2024-05-28T12:56:21.920Z\t7\tUnassessed\tEditable\tFR Peat Restoration Combined Scores\t© CNC/NRW Data may only be re-used externally under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence following an assessment of the data.\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233343738\tx:\\Physical\\Peat\\FR Peat Restoration Combined Scores.lyr\t\tThe Geospatial Services Team do not currently hold any information for this section. If you are the custodian, please contact the team so we can populate this field.\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T11:13:59.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18824\tNRW_DS123507\t2024-05-28T12:56:22.139Z\t551\tUnassessed\tEditable\tNRW Flood Risk Management (FRM) Operational Area Boundaries, post Organisational Design, July 2019\t© NERC (CEH) and CNC/NRW NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate this dataset. Those seeking such permission should approach the originator directly. Attribution Statement: © NERC (CEH). Contains Ordnance Survey data © Crown copyright and database right [2018].\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233353037\tX:\\Resource Management\\NRW Operational Areas\\NRW FRM Operational Areas.lyr\tData custodian; Gary Eccleston, Knowledge \u0026amp; Information Management, NRW Metadata point of contact; Spatial team, NRW Business contact ; Dave Tarrant, Flood Risk Analysis Group\tMap layer giving the boundaries of the post OD FRM Operational Areas.  In MyMap this is layer at Operational Layers/Resource Management Terrestrial/NRW FRM Operational Areas It is the post OD (Organisational Design) catchment boundaries for the Flood and Water Management teams (North and South Wales). Will be used to ensure enquiries, incidents etc are passed to the correct team and to show geographical areas of teams’ responsibilities.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)-Centre for Ecology and Hydrology (CEH)\t2020-05-25\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-04-17T12:26:16.000Z\tnobody nobody\t-\tPublic record\n18813\tNRW_DS123529\t2024-05-28T12:56:21.841Z\t1\tUnassessed\tEditable\tWaste Electrical and Electronic Equipment Approved Authorised Treatment Facility and Approved Exporter\t© CNC/NRW Data may be re-used under the terms of the Open Government Licence providing it is done so, acknowledging both the source and NRW\u0027s copyright. It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose. Attribution statement: Contains Natural Resources Wales information © Natural Resources Wales and Database Right. All rights Reserved\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233353239\tlist of current approvals on Public Register Copies of all historic reports are on the DMS.\tJohn Davies (weee@naturalresourceswales.gov.uk)\tPublic Register showing details of reprocessors and exporters of Waste Electrical and Electronic (WEEE) approved under the Waste Electrical and Electronic Regulations. A Spreadsheet showing the details of companies in Wales currently approved as an  Approved Authorised Treatment Facility (AATF) or Approved Exporter (AE) available on NRWs Online Public register. Only public register data specified in the WEEE Regulations are included.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t2019-01-01\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T13:02:07.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18818\tNRW_DS123530\t2024-05-28T12:56:21.946Z\t762\tValid\tEditable\tFlood Flows Estimate Data\t© CNC/NRW and Wallingford Hydrosolutions Ltd. Data may be re-used under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence.\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233353330\tWinFap Model run on request by the flood team\tGlenda Tudor-Ward, Specialist Advisor, Hydrology \u0026amp; Water Resources, Hydrology \u0026amp; Water Resources Management\tPeak flood flow and/or flood hydrograph estimates for one or more locations for one or more design events, usually calculated using gauged data, Flood Estimation Handbook Statistical and/or Rainfall Runoff methods.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)-Centre for Ecology and Hydrology (CEH)\t2023-05-05\tcreation\tnull\tnull\t2025-10-10T07:52:12.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPublic record\n18808\tNRW_DS123553\t2024-05-28T12:56:21.553Z\t2\tUnassessed\tEditable\tCamping and Caravan Sites\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233353533\tx:\\Recreation and Access\\Recreation\\Camping and Caravan Sites.lyr\t\t\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T13:02:34.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18822\tNRW_DS123582\t2024-05-28T12:56:22.028Z\t4\tUnassessed\tEditable\tMarine Habitat Vulnerability\t© CNC/NRW Data may only be re-used externally under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence following an assessment of the data.\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233353832\tx:\\Biological\\Marine Habitat\\Marine habitat v