acterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003e3.0 Otter TEST Data Discovery *** This is not a real dataset *** FULL FIELD EXAMPLE\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#CY\"\u003eTeitl Cymraeg: 3.0 Otter TEST Data Discovery *** This is not a real dataset *** FULL FIELD EXAMPLE\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eFull Field Test Record\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eExample_MEDIN_Compliant_Full_Field.lyr\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eother names\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2020-12-16\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"creation\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2023-02-03\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2024-06-30\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"revision\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eNRW_DS161273\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eTHIS IS NOT REAL DATA.      • This is NRW\u0027s test dataset to ensure staff can refer back to a fully valid record to help themselves solve validation errors • It is also to ensure all elements are displaying and exporting to multiple XML schemas.  The Metadata is written to be compliant with the NRW, MEDIN and GEMINI Standard.   • It may temporarily be in public view when checking view formats for the public but will be removed later.  We have not addressed the issue with using mean sea level as a vertical datum.  It is recommneded that to be inline with MEDIN statdanrt Vertical min and max extents are converted to Ordnance Datum Newlyn Vertical Datum - we are waiting on encoding advice from MEDIN\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eTHIS IS NOT REAL DATA.      • This is NRW\u0027s test dataset to ensure staff can refer back to a fully valid record to help themselves solve validation errors • It is also to ensure all elements are displaying and exporting to multiple XML schemas.  The Metadata is written to be compliant with the NRW, MEDIN and GEMINI Standard.   • It may temporarily be in public view when checking view formats for the public but will be removed later.  We have not addressed the issue with using mean sea level as a vertical datum.  It is recommneded that to be inline with MEDIN statdanrt Vertical min and max extents are converted to Ordnance Datum Newlyn Vertical Datum - we are waiting on encoding advice from MEDIN\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#CY\"\u003eNID DATA GO IAWN YW HWN.    Abstract Cymraeg  Datganiad priodoli Yn cynnwys gwybodaeth Cyfoeth Naturiol Cymru © Cyfoeth Naturiol Cymru a Hawl Cronfa Ddata. Cedwir pob hawl. Yn cynnwys data Arolwg Ordnans. Rhif Trwydded Arolwg Ordnans AC0000849444. Hawlfraint y Goron a Hawl Cronfa Ddata\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e           \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e           \u003cgmd:positionName gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e           \u003c/gmd:positio