c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:version\u003e           \u003cgmd:specification\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eGIS layers for habitat extent polygon data and species distribution point data. An image GIS layer is also available showing the location of any images taken.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_Format\u003e       \u003c/gmd:distributionFormat\u003e       \u003cgmd:distributionFormat xmlns:gn\u003d\"http://www.fao.org/geonetwork\"\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_Format\u003e           \u003cgmd:name\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M01/current/IMG\"\u003eImage\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:name\u003e           \u003cgmd:version\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eUnknown\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:version\u003e           \u003cgmd:specification\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eImages in .jpg format for every sample point\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:specification\u003e         \u003c/gmd:MD_Format\u003e       \u003c/gmd:distributionFormat\u003e       \u003cgmd:transferOptions\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_DigitalTransferOptions\u003e           \u003cgmd:onLine\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_OnlineResource\u003e               \u003cgmd:linkage\u003e                 \u003cgmd:URL\u003ehttps://datamap.gov.wales/layers/inspire-nrw:NRW_MAIN_RIVERS\u003c/gmd:URL\u003e               \u003c/gmd:linkage\u003e               \u003cgmd:protocol\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eWWW:LINK-1.0-http--link\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:protocol\u003e               \u003cgmd:name\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eView and Download\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:name\u003e               \u003cgmd:description gco:nilReason\u003d\"missing\"\u003e             