finio ffiniau ar gyfer timau gweithredol a reolir.\tData came from the Day 1 readiness program, in preparation for Organisational Design implementation in July 2019\t\tx:\\Resource Management\\NRW Operational Areas\\Environment Teams.lyr\tData custodian; Gary Eccleston, Knowledge \u0026amp; Information Management.\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2026-01-05\tpublication\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/capabilities/layer/340/?ows_service\u003dwms\thttps://datamap.gov.wales/layers/inspire-nrw:NRW_TEAM_BOUNDARIES\t2026-01-07T15:03:34.059Z\tMonica Jones\tGEMINI\tPublic record\n18784\tNRW_DS123443\t2024-05-28T12:55:51.743Z\t11\tUnassessed\tEditable\tFormer EA PF Areas\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233343433\tThe Geospatial Services Team do not currently hold any information for this section. If you are the custodian, please contact the team so we can populate this field.\tThe Geospatial Services Team do not currently hold any information for this section. If you are the custodian, please contact the team so we can populate this field.\t\tx:\\Resource Management\\NRW Operational Areas\\Former EA PF Areas.lyr\tBen Anscombe\t\t\t\t\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T11:13:56.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18778\tNRW_DS123444\t2024-05-28T12:55:51.529Z\t555\tUnassessed\tEditable\tLand Management Boundaries, post Organisational Design, July 2019\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233343434\tMap layer giving the boundaries of the post OD Land Management teams.  In MyMap this is layer at Operational Layers/Resource Management Terrestrial/Land Management Boundaries. It is the post OD (Organisational Design) boundaries for the Land and Assets teams. Will be used to ensure enquiries, incidents etc are passed to the correct team and to show geographical areas of teams’ responsibilities.\tData came from the Day 1 readiness program, in preparation for OD implementation.\t\tX:\\Resource Management\\NRW Operational Areas\\Land management Boundaries.lyr\tData custodian; Gary Eccleston, Kno