 (NRW)\t\t2020-10-27\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-03-07T15:59:15.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18768\tNRW_DS123448\t2024-05-28T12:55:50.911Z\t2\tUnassessed\tEditable\tNRW Hydropower teams areas\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233343438\tThis is a spatial datasets containing the extent polygons for the Natural Resources Wales hydropower team boundaries. The purpose of this data capture is to define boundaries for hydropower managed teams.  This dataset defines the hydropower team boundaries and the 18 team locations within those areas.\tThis dataset can be used in conjunction with the NRW Operational Areas. (NRW_DS116298)\t\tx:\\Resource Management\\NRW Operational Areas\\NRW Hydropower teams areas.lyr\tInternal Custodian: Gary Ecclestone, Open Access GIS Officer, GIS and Spatial Information Team Metadata contact: GIS and Spatial Data Team, NRW\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2019-03-01\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-02-04T12:56:53.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18770\tNRW_DS123449\t2024-05-28T12:55:51.100Z\t3\tUnassessed\tEditable\tNRW Landscape teams areas\t\t4f4c4942-4343-5764-6473-313233343439\tThis is a spatial datasets containing the extent polygons for the Natural Resources Wales landscape team boundaries. The purpose of this data capture is to define boundaries for landscape managed teams.  This dataset defines the landscape team boundaries and the 26 team locations within those areas.\tThis dataset can be used in conjunction with the NRW Operational Areas. (NRW_DS116298)\t\tx:\\Resource Management\\NRW Operational Areas\\NRW Landscape teams areas.lyr\tInternal Custodian: Gary Ecclestone, Open Access GIS Officer, GIS and Spatial Information Team Metadata contact: GIS and Spatial Data Team, NRW\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW)\t\t2019-03-01\tpublication\tnull\tnull\t2025-03-07T15:59:14.000Z\tAstun Technology Admin\t-\tPrivate record\n18773\tNRW_DS123450\t2024-05-28T12:55:51.106Z\t1\tUnassessed\tEditable\tNRW Species teams a